Design System Sprint:

  Bugs to fix:
    [ ] .card-base shadow fixed: replace boxShadow.sm with boxShadow.card
    [ ] .btn-primary typography added: fontSize body, letterSpacing wide

`text-brand-100` sets a base text color directly on the body element via a primitive token. This means any component that forgets to apply a type alias will silently inherit `brand-100` instead of producing invisible text. This violates the decoupling principle you established — typography should have no default color, with failures being loud. However, changing this now would break the existing Hero and other partially-built components that may be relying on this inheritance. This is a known trade-off, not a sprint blocker. Document it in `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` as a known exception with a note that it predates the alias system.
